{"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/Sci"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Subscribing","text":"Subscribing","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A consumer subscribes when its iterator is created, which is when a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"for try await"},{"text":" loop over the subject","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(or over an operator chain built on it) begins. From then on, every value sent is buffered for that consumer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"until it is consumed, so a consumer that is slower than the sender still sees every value, in order.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Values sent while there are no subscribers are discarded; they are never replayed to a later consumer."}]},{"style":"important","name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Starting a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Task","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that iterates the subject does not mean it has subscribed yet. If values must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not be missed, wait until the consumer has subscribed before sending, for example with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"code":["let subject = PassthroughSubject<Int>()","let subscribed = SingleValueSubject<Void>()","","subject.send(0) \/\/ No subscribers yet, so this value is discarded.","","Task {","    for try await value in subject.handleEvents(receiveMakeIterator: { try? subscribed.send() }) {","        print(\"Received value: \\(value)\") \/\/ prints 1, then 2","    }","}","","try await subscribed.execute()","subject.send(1)","subject.send(2)","subject.send(completion: .finished)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"A subject that broadcasts values to multiple consumers without storing a current value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Unlike ","type":"text"},{"code":"CurrentValueSubject","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"PassthroughSubject","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does not retain the most recent value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is an ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s PassthroughSubject.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7Afluent18PassthroughSubjectC","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PassthroughSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"roleHeading":"Class","title":"Passthrough